      }, {
        "text": " sandbox, and commits the code to `/.avos/shared/skills/{skillName}.ts`.\n* Subsequent runs execute in"
      }, {
        "text": " **100ms for $0.0001** without re-prompting the LLM.\n\n### 2. Video-"
