      }, {
        "text": "\n* The compiler synthesizes parameterized TypeScript using universal `ctx` primitives, tests the code in Tier 4 Kitesurf, and saves"
      }, {
        "text": " the verified tool to the skill library.\n\n---\n\n## 8. Universal Runtime SDK (`ctx`) \u0026 Zero-Leak Credential"
