        "text": "Here is the complete quantitative analytics breakdown of the **Gemini API Free Tier limits**,"
      }, {
        "text": " how to pace your requests, how to budget your daily quota with a self-healing review loop, and the updated GitHub"
      }, {
        "text": " Actions runner code.\n\n---\n\n### 1. The Analytics: Gemini API Free Tier Limits\n\nGoogle AI Studio enforces limits across"
      }, {
        "text": " three distinct dimensions on Flash models (Gemini 2.0 Flash / 2.5 Flash):\n\n| Qu"
