      }, {
        "text": " | **This is your true daily bottleneck.** Reset occurs"
      }, {
        "text": " daily at midnight Pacific Time (07:00 UTC / 09:00 CAT)."
      }, {
        "text": " |\n\n---\n\n### 2. Request Math: The 3-Step Review \u0026 Retry Pipeline\n\nWith your proposed **Review"
