lar add-ons.\n3. **Gadgets** \u003d User-facing, interactive micro-apps with UI viewports and SQLite DBs.\n4. **Daemons** (or **Active Services**) \u003d The background, autonomous data-processors combining a DO SQLite database with Dynamic Workflows.",
